- Si.
- Hola.

328
00:25:46,111 --> 00:25:47,120
Hola.

329
00:25:47,155 --> 00:25:48,889
Es el nuevo inquilino.

330
00:25:49,354 --> 00:25:51,771
- Donald
- Jesse.

331
